error[E0545]: 'Guest' has a 'set' hook, so 'guest' needs an initializer
 --> $DIR/uninitialized-field.nra:9:16
  |
3 |     | set: value;
  |     ------------- the 'set' hook
...
9 |     export let guest: Guest;
  |                ^^^^^ declared without an initializer
  |
  = note: a default nil would be an admission the source does not show
help: initialize it with nil, which the 'set' hook then admits when the declaration runs
  |
9 |     export let guest: Guest = nil;
  |                            ++++++

For more information about this error, try `neura explain E0545`.
